                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <br><br>
                            <input type="text" name="CSRFToken" value="<%= locals.CSRFToken || '' %>" hidden>
                            <input onclick="saveCustomMinecraftModules()" type="button" value="Save">
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="top">
                    <div class="setup">
                        <h1>Edit your page info</h1>
                        <form action="./setup" method="post">
                            <p>Small description (100 characters)</p>
                            <input type="text" onchange="IIlIIIlIIIlll()" id="slogan" name="slogan" maxlength="100"
                                value="<%= locals.slogan || ''%>">
                            <p>Description (2000 characters)</p>
                            <textarea id="description" onchange="IIlIIIlIIIlll()" rows=20 name="description"
                                maxlength="2000"><%= locals.description || ''%></textarea>
                            <input class="button" type="submit" onclick="IIlIIIlIIIlll()" name="confirm" id="checkbox3"
                                value="Done" disabled>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info">
                        <h1>Point Info</h1>
                        <p>Streamer Options will try to ask Twitch which viewers are watching your stream every minute,
                            and
                            grant every viewer 10 points.</p>
                        <p>Depending on demand, there is a small chance that the interval will be longer than a minute.
                        </p>
                        <h2>Point pricing guide</h2>
                        <p>A viewer gets 10 points per minute.<br>That is 600 points every hour.</p>
                        <p>Be careful when pricing your modules, you don't want to make the game unplayable (most of the
                            time).</p>
                        <p><strong>For example:</strong> If you want a viewer to be able to join your Minecraft server
                            after watching your stream for 12 hours, you should price the whitelist module at
                            <strong>7.200</strong> points.
                        </p>
                        <h2>Streamer Options Token</h2>
                        <p>Do not show this token to anyone! This token is used by our services to receive events
                            when someone uses their points! You should only use this token when we ask for it while
                            configuring your settings on our mods and plugins.</p>
                        <input type="password" id="tokenfield"
                            value="<%= locals.token || 'Oops! Something went wrong. Try again later.'%>" disabled>
                        <button onclick="tokenButton()" id="token-button">Show Token</button>
                        <p>Token compromised? Mail us at <a
                                href="mailto://contact@streameroptions.com">contact@streameroptions.com</a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h1>Minecraft Server Modules</h1>
                <div class="module-container minecraft">
                    <% for(let key in locals.modules.minecraft) { let module=locals.modules.minecraft[key]; %>
                        <div class="module <%= module.enabled == 1 ? 'module-active' : '' %>">
                            <div>
                                <div class="title">
                                    <%= module.title %>
                                </div>
                                <div class="description">
                                    <%= module.description %>
                                </div>
                                <div class="price">
                                    <%= module.price %> Points
                                </div>
                                <label for="price">Price</label>
                                <input type="number" name="price" class="price-input" value="<%= module.price %>">
                                <input type="hidden" name="module_id" class="module_input" value="<%= module.m_id %>">
                                <div class="toggle-slider">
                                    <input type="checkbox" name="toggled" id="toggle<%= key %>"
                                        class="toggle-slider-checkbox toggle" <%=module.enabled==1 ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                                    <label for="toggle<%= key %>" class="toggle-slider-label"></label>
                                </div>
                                <input type="submit" onclick="saveModule(`<%= locals.CSRFToken || '' %>`)" value="Save" class="save-button" hidden>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <% } %>
                            <div class="module module-active">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="title">
                                        Custom Commands
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="description">
                                        Edit your custom commands.
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="price" id="minecraftCustomCommandsPrice">
                                        <%= customMinecraftModulesEnabled %>/5 Enabled
                                    </div>
                                    <input onclick="showMinecraftCustomCommandEditor()" type="submit" value="Edit"
                                        class="save-button" id="minecraftCustomCommandsButton">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                </div>
            </main>
            </div>
            <script src="../../js2.js"></script>
            <%- include('parts/footer.ejs') %>
    </body>

</html>